      "writtenOn": "2025-06-25T08:11:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Either the method is deprecated, then we should stop using it\n\nYeah this is the part I am struggling with. It\u0027s not deprecated for us but it\u0027s deprecated for the OS community.\n\nI guess that means it\u0027s overall deprecated *sigh*\n\nLGTM on this change then.",
      "parentUuid": "cdbb95b7_8cffdf80",
      "range": {
